  "summary": {
    "text": "Ministral 3 is a series of dense Mistral AI language models in 3B, 8B and 14B sizes aimed at edge and local use, released on 2 December 2025 with Mistral Large 3. Each size has base, instruct and reasoning checkpoints with image input under Apache 2.0; Mistral's paper says all were derived from Mistral Small 3.1 by pruning and distillation.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "src.mistral.mistral-3-announcement"
      },
      {
        "id": "src.mistral.ministral-3-paper"
      },
